{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Yogas and doshas"},"description":"List the yogas and doshas in a Vedic chart with Moon Dasha's yoga engine: each formed yoga and dosha with its strength (Moon Dasha's 0 to 5 index, not a probability), how it formed in this chart, any cancellations, its meaning and the planets whose periods it shows most in; weak yogas by name; cancelled doshas with what cancelled them; and the named doshas that are not present, such as Mangal Dosha or Kala Sarpa. Reads the birth chart (D1) or a divisional chart (varga). Needs the birth date, the local birth time and the birthplace (a place_id from find_place). The findings are Moon Dasha's calculations; interpret them as tendencies and never predict death, illness, a child's sex, markets, elections or court cases.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"ayanamsa":{"description":"Default Lahiri. Krishnamurti is the KP ayanamsa.","enum":["Lahiri","TrueLahiri","Krishnamurti","Raman","Fagan","Yukteshwar","Galactic","Dhruva","Pushya","Ushashashi","ChandraHari","TrueRevati","SuryaSiddhanta","Tropical"],"type":"string"},"date":{"description":"Birth date, YYYY-MM-DD.","pattern":"^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$","type":"string"},"gender":{"description":"The person's sex, for the few yogas whose rule depends on it (Maha Bhagya). Set only when the person has said; without it those yogas are left out.","enum":["male","female"],"type":"string"},"node":{"description":"Rahu and Ketu by the mean node (default) or the true node.","enum":["mean","true"],"type":"string"},"place_id":{"description":"The place_id find_place returned for the birthplace.","maxLength":80,"type":"string"},"time":{"description":"Local clock time at the birthplace, 24-hour HH:MM or HH:MM:SS. Required: if the person does not know it, ask for their best guess and set time_is_approximate.","pattern":"^